meta {
  name: pairing status
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/internal/rcs/pair/status
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  How the current pairing attempt is going. The page polls this every 2 seconds.

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "running": true,
      "paired": false,
      "done": false,
      "phone": "",
      "error": ""
    }
  }
  ```

  `done` with `paired` false means it failed, and `error` says why — usually the
  QR was not scanned inside the 10-minute window.

  All-false means no attempt has been started on this server.
}
